<title>USA: Sun Co Inc Q4 earnings summmary.</title>
<headline>Sun Co Inc Q4 earnings summmary.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $ 3.22   profit     $  0.09</p>
<p> Net loss		 224,000   profit	18,000</p>
<p> Revs		   3,027,000		2,439,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  73,000		   74,500</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $ 2.17   profit    $   1.29</p>
<p> Net loss		 115,000   profit     140,000</p>
<p> Revs		  11,300,000		9,877,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  73,600		   91,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 fourth quarter and year include $201 million after-tax charges, including: $80 million for reconfiguration of Puerto Rico Refinery; $85 million for off-take agreement to purchase MBTE; $36 million environmental remediation related write-downs.</p>
<p>Excluding charges, fourth quarter operating loss was $23 million or $0.47 per share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
